('WB06',[45,46,47],'Dictionary and misspelling branches','Freeze actual lexicon/language/options; unmatched spelling can accept a suggestion letter or Edit4 followed by F7. A correct proper name uses Skip2 for rest-of-document scope. Pictured examples and vocabulary-size prose do not establish licensed identical dictionary results.',['T1','Q1','Q2','Q3']),
